# InGENeer scope

Canonical root: `~/Dev/CAD/projects/InGENeer/` (compat: `~/Dev/InGENeer`).

## Primary folders

| Area | Path | IDE / compiler |
|------|------|----------------|
| Orchestrator | `orchestrator/` | Python 3, ruff, pytest; venv at `orchestrator/.venv` |
| iCAD bridge | `icad-addin/` | .NET — `InGENeer.IcadAddin.slnx` |
| Contracts | `schemas/` | JSON Schema only |
| Governance | `docs/governance/autonomation/` | Read before architecture changes |

## Verify

```bash
cd orchestrator && pip install -e ".[dev]" && ruff check src tests && python -m pytest -q
dotnet build icad-addin/InGENeer.IcadAddin.slnx -c Release
```

Cross-CAD context: open `cad-platform.code-workspace` or `CAD/diagrams/cad-platform-explorer.html`.
